    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59142" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρνοψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οπος</span>, ὁ, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>locust</i>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρνοψ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.64
			</span></i> (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορνώπιδες</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώνωπες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>):—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κορνοπίων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωνος</span>, ὁ, <i>Locust-scarer</i>, title of Heracles
			at Oeta, Str.l.c.</div>
